Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends},
 vortex-core,
 caddy,
 cockpit-system,
 cockpit-storaged,
 cockpit-networkmanager
Description: Vortex OS web management UI
 Caddy as the single TLS entry point on 443, Cockpit (socket-activated,
 localhost-only) under /system/, the OpenClaw gateway under /claw/, a static
 dark landing page, and the vortex-stats daemon serving live system stats
 and the first-boot wizard backend on localhost:8090.
